            "line": 98,
            "text": "theorem stress_outside {p : Point} (hX : 0 < p.1) (hη : p.2 ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1)\n    (hout : p.1 < d.modulation.left ∨ (ModulatedProfileAssembly.repairPatch W).right < p.1) :\n    stress v.profiles F.data.h p = stress W.profiles F.data.h p"
